  },
  data: {
    LLM: "Caller draws cards one at a time from the calling pack and announces rank and suit (e.g., 'five of diamonds'). Players who hold the called card turn it face down. First player to turn all cards face down calls 'Bingo!' (or 'Bango!'/'Hoy!') and wins. If playing for money, winner's hand is checked against the calling pack to verify all cards were called.",
    Player: "Caller draws cards one at a time from the calling pack and announces rank and suit (e.g., 'five of diamonds'). Players who hold the called card turn it face down. First player to turn all cards face down calls 'Bingo!' (or 'Bango!'/'Hoy!') and wins. If playing for money, winner's hand is checked against the calling pack to verify all cards were called.",
    objective: 'Be the first player to have all your cards called/turned face down.',
    gameplay: "Caller draws cards one at a time from the calling pack and announces rank and suit (e.g., 'five of diamonds'). Players who hold the called card turn it face down. First player to turn all cards face down calls 'Bingo!' (or 'Bango!'/'Hoy!') and wins. If playing for money, winner's hand is checked against the calling pack to verify all cards were called.",
    keyRules: [
      'Two packs: one for dealing, one for calling',
      'Cards dealt face up (basic) or face down (some variants)',
      'Caller announces rank and suit (or just rank in suit-ignored variants)',
      'Players turn down matching cards',
      'First to turn all cards down wins',
      "Winner's hand verified against calling pack in gambling games",
    ],
